登记后就算正式报名参赛了。

scripts.text:
{0}
The Magic Tournament is going to start soon.
Enter the portal to the south and you can join in.

scripts.translation:
{0}
魔法大赛即将开始。
进入南边的传送门就能参赛。

scripts.text:
{0}
Thank you for visiting the Geffen Magic Tournament.
What can I do for you?

scripts.translation:
{0}
感谢您光临吉芬魔法大赛。
请问有什么可以帮您？

scripts.text:
{0}
This festival used to be a more studious event with scholars discussing magical methods.
Now it's all about fun and a big party.

scripts.translation:
{0}
这个庆典过去更偏重学术，学者们会聚在一起探讨魔法技法。
如今倒成了一场热闹的大聚会。

scripts.text:
{0}
Now it has become almost exclusively a fighting tournament.
The most famous Mages from all over the world come for the tournament.

scripts.translation:
{0}
现在，它几乎完全变成了格斗比赛。
世界各地最有名的魔法师都会来参赛。

scripts.text:
{0}
There is no registration fee to enter.
The only requirement is to pass a simple test.

{0}
If you fail you will automatically be eliminated from the list but you can try again as many times as you wish.
Do you want to take the test?

scripts.translation:
{0}
失败后，您会自动从名单中除名，但可以不限次数地重试。
要参加测试吗？

scripts.text:
{0}
You can participate in the Magic Tournament after passing the test.
Then, let us begin!

scripts.translation:
{0}
通过测试就能参加魔法大赛。
那么，开始吧！

{0}
女士们，先生们！
欢迎来到吉芬魔法大赛！

{0}
今年的比赛分为A、B两组。
两组的优胜者将在决赛中一决高下，争夺冠军。

{0}
我是A组的主持人，吉芬学院大师~！
大魔导师赞扎巴尔·赫尔莫德！

scripts.text:
{0}
I am honored to be this year's MC.
Now, it's time for the matches to begin.

scripts.translation:
{0}
很荣幸能担任今年的主持人。
现在，比赛即将开始。

scripts.text:
{0}
You won the competition!
Congratulations!

scripts.translation:
{0}
您赢得了比赛！
恭喜！

scripts.text:
{0}
By the way, the Academy Master has
something to tell you!

scripts.translation:
{0}
恭喜！
这届选手的实力，是历届大赛中最强的。

scripts.text:
{0}
I present to you your earned ^55CC55Geffen
Magic Tournament Coins.^000000

{0}
Your name will be remembered in the
history books of Geffen.

scripts.translation:
{0}
再次恭喜您。
希望您接下来也能尽情享受吉芬的庆典。

{0}
恭喜！您击败了A组的所有对手！
祝您在决赛中好运！

scripts.text:
{0}
Need more time to prepare I see.
Not a problem, talk to me when you're ready.

scripts.translation:
{0}
看来您还需要更多时间准备。
没关系，准备好后再来找我。

scripts.text:
{0}
Let's take a rain check on our match.
We'll fight next time we meet...

scripts.translation:
{0}
我们的比赛改日再约吧。
下次见面时再一决高下...

scripts.text:
{0}
That was a good match~!
Not bad at all~!

scripts.translation:
{0}
这是一场精彩的比赛~！
表现相当不错~！

scripts.text:
{0}
You have been very impressive today.
I want to give you a present~!

scripts.translation:
{0}
你今天的表现真让人印象深刻。
我想送你一份礼物~！

scripts.text:
{0}
It was a good game.
Hope you get farther next time.

scripts.translation:
{0}
打得不错。
希望下次你能晋级到更后面的轮次。

scripts.text:
{0}
